stateDiagram-v2
    %% A feature's brief, groomed until its own check accepts it. GROOMING
    %% waits as a look while the brief is missing or refused: grooming is a
    %% person answering `amy-groom`'s questions, not something this walk does.
    %% BRIEFED returns the criteria the brief settled, which a project hands
    %% its work and its proof.
    classDef waiting stroke-dasharray: 4 4

    [*] --> GROOMING
    GROOMING --> BRIEFED: the brief answers every section and its check accepts it
    BRIEFED --> [*]

    class GROOMING waiting
